            "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are wearing medium or heavy armor.</p><hr /><p>With a mighty blow, you send an enemy flying backward and onto the ground. Strike a foe. This Strike deals an extra die of weapon damage. If you hit and deal damage, you can automatically @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Shove] the target, with the same benefits as the Shove action (including the critical success effect, if your Strike was a critical hit). The target then falls @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Prone]. This counts as two attacks when calculating your multiple attack penalty.</p>"
